"This package hosts all public symbols of the clipboard extension: :class:`ClipboardPlugin` (stage one, "
"the plugin), :func:`use_clipboard` (stage two, enablement), and three tool classes "
"(:class:`ClipboardCutTool` / :class:`ClipboardCopyTool` / :class:`ClipboardPasteTool`); the public API is "
"re-exported through this ``__init__``."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard:8 of
