#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCopyTool:5 of
msgid ""
"与 :class:`ClipboardCutTool` 全同，唯一差异：不删除源文件区段 （无落盘副作用，源文件只读）。阈值双限与 "
"``output`` 语义一致。"
msgstr ""
"Identical to :class:`ClipboardCutTool`, with one difference: it does not delete the source file region "
"(no on-disk side effect; the source file is read-only). The dual threshold limits and ``output`` "
"semantics are the same."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCopyTool:8 of
msgid ":class:`ClipboardCutTool`、:class:`ClipboardPasteTool`"
