"参数 / IO / 阈值错误（路径、区间形态、越界、剪贴板超限、 未启用）抛 ``ValueError``——经 "
"``Tool.__call__`` 包装为 ``status=\"error\"`` 的 ``ToolResult`` （LLM "
"可见、可自纠正）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameter / IO / threshold errors (path, range shape, out-of-bounds, clipboard over limit, "
"not enabled) raise ``ValueError`` — wrapped by ``Tool.__call__`` into a ``ToolResult`` with "
"``status=\"error\"`` (visible to the LLM, self-correctable)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCopyTool.execute:8 of
msgid "与 :class:`ClipboardCutTool.execute` 全同，唯一差异：不删除 源文件区段。"
msgstr "Identical to :class:`ClipboardCutTool.execute`, with one difference: it does not delete the source region."

