#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool:1 of
msgid "``clipboard-cut``——剪切文件区段到剪贴板或文件（可写工具）。"
msgstr "``clipboard-cut`` — cut a file region to the clipboard or a file (writable tool)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool:5 of
msgid ""
"参数：``path`` （目标文件，必填，遵循 ``cwd`` 基准口径—— ``cwd=None`` 时仅绝对路径）；``cwd`` "
"（路径基准，默认 ``None``， 给则必须绝对路径，对 ``path`` 与文件形态的 ``output`` 同时生效）； ``start``"
" / ``end`` （必填，两种形态不得混用——① 两个 ``int`` 表示行号，1 起，start 包含、end 排除；② 两个 "
"``\"line,offset\"`` 形式字符串，行 1 起、offset 0 起，end 位置 排除）；``output`` "
"（``\"clipboard\"`` （默认）或绝对路径文件）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters: ``path`` (target file, required, follows the ``cwd`` base convention — with ``cwd=None`` "
"only absolute paths are accepted); ``cwd`` (path base, default ``None``, if given must be an absolute "
"path, applies to both ``path`` and file-form ``output``); ``start`` / ``end`` (required, the two shapes "
"must not be mixed — 1) two ``int`` values as line numbers, 1-based, start inclusive and end exclusive; "
"2) two ``\"line,offset\"`` form strings, line 1-based and offset 0-based, end position exclusive); "
"``output`` (``\"clipboard\"`` (default) or an absolute-path file)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool:12 of
msgid "标准剪切语义：区段写入目标后，源文件立即删除该段 （落盘副作用，与编辑器 cut 一致）。"
msgstr "Standard cut semantics: after the region is written to the target, the source file immediately deletes that region (on-disk side effect, consistent with editor cut)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool:14 of
msgid ""
"``output=\"clipboard\"``：写入 ``caller`` 的 ``state.clipboard_buffer`` "
"（写透落盘）；阈值双限——内容 行数超过 ``clipboard_max_lines`` （默认 500）或字符数超过 "
"``clipboard_max_chars`` （默认 10k）→ error ``ToolResult``， 提示改用文件输出。"
msgstr ""
"``output=\"clipboard\"``: writes to ``caller``'s ``state.clipboard_buffer`` (write-through persistence); "
"dual threshold limits — content line count exceeding ``clipboard_max_lines`` (default 500) or character "
"count exceeding ``clipboard_max_chars`` (default 10k) → error ``ToolResult``, suggesting file output instead."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool:19 of
msgid "``output`` 为文件：绝对路径、覆盖写、上级目录自动创建；无阈值 限制（大段内容走文件正是阈值的存在理由）。"
msgstr "``output`` as a file: absolute path, overwrite write, parent directories auto-created; no threshold limit (sending large content to a file is exactly why the threshold exists)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool:21 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：相对路径且无 ``cwd`` / ``cwd`` 非绝对 / 两形态混用 / 行号或 offset 越界（行号超文件行数、offset "
"超行尾）/ 路径是目录 → error ``ToolResult`` （LLM 可见、可自纠正，不抛异常）。"
msgstr ""
"Edge cases: relative path without ``cwd`` / non-absolute ``cwd`` / mixed shapes / line number or offset "
"out of bounds (line number beyond file line count, offset past end of line) / path is a directory → "
"error ``ToolResult`` (visible to the LLM, self-correctable, no exception raised)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool:24 of
msgid "危险面：删改源文件。审批属策略层（``before_tool_call``）。"
msgstr "Danger surface: modifies and deletes content in the source file. Approval belongs to the policy layer (``before_tool_call``)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool:26 of
msgid ""
":class:`ClipboardCopyTool`、:class:`ClipboardPasteTool`、 "
":func:`flowing.plugins.clipboard.use_clipboard`"
msgstr ""
":class:`ClipboardCopyTool`, :class:`ClipboardPasteTool`, "
":func:`flowing.plugins.clipboard.use_clipboard`"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool.execute:1 of
msgid "剪切区段并返回收据文本（目标、行数/字符数）。"
msgstr "Cut the region and return receipt text (target, line/character counts)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool.execute:8 of
msgid "区段写入目标后源文件立即删除该段（标准剪切语义）。"
msgstr "After the region is written to the target, the source file immediately deletes that region (standard cut semantics)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool.execute:17 of
msgid "收据文本（已剪切 N 行 / M 字符到剪贴板或文件）。"
msgstr "Receipt text (N lines / M characters cut to the clipboard or file)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool:1 of
msgid "``clipboard-paste``——把剪贴板或文件内容插入目标文件（可写工具）。"
msgstr "``clipboard-paste`` — insert clipboard or file content into a target file (writable tool)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool:5 of
msgid ""
"参数：``path`` （目标文件，必填，遵循 ``cwd`` 基准口径—— ``cwd=None`` 时仅绝对路径）；``cwd`` "
"（路径基准，默认 ``None``， 给则必须绝对路径，对 ``path`` 与文件形态的 ``source`` 同时生效）； "
"``source`` （``\"clipboard\"`` （默认）或绝对路径文件）；``pos`` 必填，插入位置——``int`` 为行号（1"
" 起，内容作为整行块插入到 第 N 行之前，N 等于行数加 1 即追加末尾）；``\"line,offset\"`` 表示行内 offset "
"处插入，不改动行结构）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters: ``path`` (target file, required, follows the ``cwd`` base convention — with ``cwd=None`` "
"only absolute paths are accepted); ``cwd`` (path base, default ``None``, if given must be an absolute "
"path, applies to both ``path`` and file-form ``source``); ``source`` (``\"clipboard\"`` (default) or an "
"absolute-path file); ``pos`` required, insertion position — ``int`` is a line number (1-based, content "
"inserted as a whole-line block before line N; N equal to line count plus 1 appends at the end); "
"``\"line,offset\"`` inserts at the offset within the line without altering line structure)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool:12 of
msgid ""
"一次性语义：``source=\"clipboard\"`` 且粘贴成功后，清空内存 剪贴板（``state.clipboard_buffer ="
" None``）——防止剪贴板内容 长期占用 state.jsonl 体积；连续粘贴需重新 cut/copy。"
msgstr ""
"One-shot semantics: when ``source=\"clipboard\"`` and the paste succeeds, the in-memory clipboard is "
"cleared (``state.clipboard_buffer = None``) — this prevents clipboard content from occupying state.jsonl "
"volume long-term; consecutive pastes require re-cutting/copying."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool:15 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：剪贴板为空 / 相对路径且无 ``cwd`` / ``cwd`` 非绝对 / pos 越界 / 路径是目录 → error "
"``ToolResult``。清空只发生在 成功粘贴后（失败保留缓冲，LLM 可修正 pos 重试）。"
msgstr ""
"Edge cases: empty clipboard / relative path without ``cwd`` / non-absolute ``cwd`` / pos out of bounds / "
"path is a directory → error ``ToolResult``. Clearing only happens after a successful paste (failure "
"retains the buffer; the LLM can fix pos and retry)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool:18 of
msgid "危险面：改目标文件。审批属策略层（``before_tool_call``）。"
msgstr "Danger surface: modifies the target file. Approval belongs to the policy layer (``before_tool_call``)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool:20 of
msgid ":class:`ClipboardCutTool`、:class:`ClipboardCopyTool`"
msgstr ":class:`ClipboardCutTool`, :class:`ClipboardCopyTool`"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool.execute:1 of
msgid "插入内容并返回收据文本；剪贴板来源成功后清空缓冲。"
msgstr "Insert content and return receipt text; clears the buffer after a successful clipboard-sourced paste."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool.execute:5 of
msgid ""
"参数 / IO 错误（路径、pos 形态与越界、剪贴板为空、未启用） 抛 ``ValueError``——经 ``Tool.__call__`` "
"包装为 ``status=\"error\"`` 的 ``ToolResult`` （LLM 可见、可自纠正）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameter / IO errors (path, pos shape and out-of-bounds, empty clipboard, not enabled) raise "
"``ValueError`` — wrapped by ``Tool.__call__`` into a ``ToolResult`` with ``status=\"error\"`` (visible "
"to the LLM, self-correctable)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool.execute:8 of
msgid "全部校验先于任何落盘（失败保留缓冲，LLM 可修正 pos 重试）； ``source=\"clipboard\"`` 且粘贴成功后才清空缓冲。"
msgstr "All validation precedes any disk write (failure retains the buffer; the LLM can fix pos and retry); the buffer is cleared only after a successful paste with ``source=\"clipboard\"``."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool.execute:12 of
msgid "``\"clipboard\"`` （默认）或来源文件路径。"
msgstr "``\"clipboard\"`` (default) or a source file path."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool.execute:13 of
msgid "插入位置（``int`` 行号 或 ``\"line,offset\"``）。"
msgstr "Insertion position (``int`` line number or ``\"line,offset\"``)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardPasteTool.execute:17 of
msgid "收据文本（已粘贴 N 行 / M 字符到目标文件）。"
msgstr "Receipt text (N lines / M characters pasted into the target file)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin:1 of
msgid "剪贴板扩展插件——阶段一入口：注册三件工具。"
msgstr "Clipboard extension plugin — stage-one entry: registers the three tools."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:4
#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin:4
#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:4 of
msgid "功能介绍"
msgstr "Overview"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin:5 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.install(ClipboardPlugin())`` 时框架调用 ``install(runtime)``， 注册 "
"``clipboard-cut`` / ``clipboard-copy`` / ``clipboard-paste`` "
"三件全局工具。缓冲持久化不在 install 挂载——状态键是 per-agent 声明，由 ``use_clipboard(self)`` 在各"
" Agent 的 ``setup()`` 中完成 （与 cron 的 ``cron_jobs`` 同构）。"
msgstr ""
"When ``runtime.install(ClipboardPlugin())`` is called, the framework invokes ``install(runtime)``, "
"registering the three global tools ``clipboard-cut`` / ``clipboard-copy`` / ``clipboard-paste``. Buffer "
"persistence is not mounted in install — the state key is a per-agent declaration, completed by "
"``use_clipboard(self)`` in each agent's ``setup()`` (isomorphic to cron's ``cron_jobs``)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin:13 of
msgid ""
"``install()`` 同步完成三次 ``register_tool`` （插件约定：``install`` "
"只注册）；不挂载任何状态持久化；不读取其他插件状态。"
msgstr ""
"``install()`` synchronously performs three ``register_tool`` calls (plugin contract: ``install`` only "
"registers); it mounts no state persistence and reads no other plugin state."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin:15 of
msgid "构造无参数、无注册副作用。"
msgstr "The constructor takes no arguments and has no registration side effects."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin:17 of
msgid ":func:`use_clipboard` （阶段二入口）"
msgstr ":func:`use_clipboard` (stage-two entry)"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin.name:1
#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin.name:1 of
msgid "注册名（显式声明，无框架默认；推荐格式见 ``flowing.plugins`` 命名约定）。"
msgstr "Registration name (explicitly declared, no framework default; see the ``flowing.plugins`` naming convention for the recommended format)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin.dependencies:1
#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin.dependencies:1 of
msgid "依赖声明（类属性元数据）。本插件无依赖，为空列表。"
msgstr "Dependency declaration (class-attribute metadata). This plugin has no dependencies; it is an empty list."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin.install:1 of
msgid "注册三件剪贴板工具到 Runtime 注册表。"
msgstr "Register the three clipboard tools into the Runtime registry."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin.install:5 of
msgid "三次 ``register_tool`` 全部同步完成（install 只注册）。"
msgstr "All three ``register_tool`` calls complete synchronously (install only registers)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin.install:6 of
msgid ""
"不挂载任何状态持久化（``clipboard_buffer`` 是 per-agent 声明，归 "
"``use_clipboard``）；不读取其他插件状态。"
msgstr ""
"Mounts no state persistence (``clipboard_buffer`` is a per-agent declaration owned by "
"``use_clipboard``); reads no other plugin state."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin.install:8 of
msgid "后置条件：三件工具已注册；此后每个 ``use_clipboard`` 的 Agent 各自获得缓冲声明与阈值配置。"
msgstr "Postcondition: the three tools are registered; thereafter each agent that calls ``use_clipboard`` gets its own buffer declaration and threshold configuration."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin.install:11 of
msgid "当前安装的 Runtime 实例。"
msgstr "The Runtime instance being installed."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.ClipboardPlugin.install:13 of
msgid ""
":func:`use_clipboard`、 "
":class:`flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool`"
msgstr ""
":func:`use_clipboard`, "
":class:`flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools.ClipboardCutTool`"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:1 of
msgid "Agent 级启用剪贴板（阶段二入口，``setup()`` 中调用）。"
msgstr "Enable the clipboard at agent level (stage-two entry, called in ``setup()``)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:5 of
msgid ""
"两件事：① 声明 ``clipboard_buffer`` 状态键（默认 ``None`` 表示 空剪贴板；写透落盘、recover 可恢复）；②"
" 把阈值写到实例属性 ``clipboard_max_lines`` / ``clipboard_max_chars`` （插件绑定成员 "
"命名约定：注册名 underscore 前缀），三件工具经 ``caller`` 读取。"
msgstr ""
"Two things: 1) declare the ``clipboard_buffer`` state key (default ``None`` means an empty clipboard; "
"write-through persistence, recoverable on recover); 2) write the thresholds to the instance attributes "
"``clipboard_max_lines`` / ``clipboard_max_chars`` (plugin-bound member naming convention: registration "
"name with underscore prefix), read by the three tools via ``caller``."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:11 of
msgid "使用示例"
msgstr "Examples"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:22 of
msgid "状态键声明与阈值赋值同步完成；LLM 可见性仍需 ``agent.add_tool(\"clipboard-cut\")`` 等显式声明。"
msgstr "State key declaration and threshold assignment complete synchronously; LLM visibility still requires explicit declarations such as ``agent.add_tool(\"clipboard-cut\")``."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:24 of
msgid ""
"参数校验：``max_lines`` / ``max_chars`` 必须为正整数，否则 ``ValueError`` "
"（不产生任何注册副作用——先校验后注册）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameter validation: ``max_lines`` / ``max_chars`` must be positive integers, otherwise ``ValueError`` "
"(no registration side effects — validate first, then register)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:26 of
msgid ""
"可重复调用：``state.register`` 幂等（键未持久化时写入默认值、已 持久化时跳过并返回持久值），对同一实例重复调用不报错，阈值 "
"以最后一次调用为准；恢复时 setup 在新实例上执行同样安全。"
msgstr ""
"Repeatable calls: ``state.register`` is idempotent (writes the default value when the key is not "
"persisted, skips and returns the persisted value when it is); repeated calls on the same instance do not "
"error, and thresholds follow the last call; on recovery, setup executing on a new instance is equally safe."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:29 of
msgid "不自动 ``add_tool`` （可见性是 Agent 开发者的显式决策）；不注册 钩子点（剪贴板无事件面）。"
msgstr "Does not auto ``add_tool`` (visibility is the agent developer's explicit decision); registers no hook points (the clipboard has no event surface)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:32 of
msgid "要启用的 Agent 实例。"
msgstr "The agent instance to enable."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:33 of
msgid "剪贴板行数上限（正整数，默认 500）。"
msgstr "Clipboard line count limit (positive integer, default 500)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:34 of
msgid "剪贴板字符数上限（正整数，默认 10_000）。"
msgstr "Clipboard character count limit (positive integer, default 10_000)."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.clipboard.rst
msgid "抛出"
msgstr "Raises"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:35 of
msgid "``max_lines`` / ``max_chars`` 不是正整数时 （先校验后注册，不产生副作用）。"
msgstr "When ``max_lines`` / ``max_chars`` are not positive integers (validate first, then register; no side effects)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard.use_clipboard:38 of
msgid ":class:`ClipboardPlugin`、 :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.register_state`"
msgstr ":class:`ClipboardPlugin`, :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.register_state`"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.clipboard.rst:10
msgid "Submodules"
msgstr "Submodules"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.clipboard.rst:13
msgid "flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard module"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:1 of
msgid "flowing.plugins.clipboard —— 剪贴板扩展（ClipboardPlugin / use_clipboard）。"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.clipboard — clipboard extension (ClipboardPlugin / use_clipboard)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:5 of
msgid ""
"剪贴板是 Flowing 的内置扩展（随 ``flowing`` 包发布但不自动启用）， 为 Agent 提供“文件区段的剪切 / 复制 / "
"粘贴”能力——面向 LLM 跨文件 搬运代码段的常见场景：LLM 先 cut/copy 一个区段（小内容进内存剪贴板、 大内容落文件），再 "
"paste 到目标位置，避免在上下文里来回复述大段文本。"
msgstr ""
"The clipboard is a builtin extension of Flowing (shipped with the ``flowing`` package but not "
"auto-enabled), providing agents with \"cut / copy / paste file region\" capability — aimed at the common "
"scenario of an LLM moving code segments across files: the LLM first cuts/copies a region (small content "
"goes into the in-memory clipboard, large content goes to a file), then pastes it at the target position, "
"avoiding restating large text blocks back and forth in the context."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:10 of
msgid ""
"框架核心不内置剪贴板——它是策略性便利设施，由扩展承载；核心只提供它 复用的机制：插件状态持久化（``Agent.state`` "
"——剪贴板缓冲就是一个状态 键）、工具注册（``Runtime.register_tool``）、caller 注入（工具经 ``caller``"
" 读写属主 Agent 的缓冲与阈值）。"
msgstr ""
"The framework core does not include a clipboard — it is a policy-level convenience facility carried by "
"an extension; the core only provides the mechanisms it reuses: plugin state persistence (``Agent.state`` "
"— the clipboard buffer is just a state key), tool registration (``Runtime.register_tool``), and caller "
"injection (tools read and write the owning agent's buffer and thresholds via ``caller``)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:16 of
msgid "注册面清单"
msgstr "Registry Surface Inventory"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:17 of
msgid "启用方式："
msgstr "Enablement:"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:19 of
msgid ""
"阶段一：``runtime.install(ClipboardPlugin())``——``install(runtime)`` 注册 "
"``clipboard-cut`` / ``clipboard-copy`` / ``clipboard-paste`` "
"三件全局工具（注册不等于可见：Agent 仍需 ``add_tool`` 才对 LLM 可见）；"
msgstr ""
"Stage one: ``runtime.install(ClipboardPlugin())`` — ``install(runtime)`` registers the three global "
"tools ``clipboard-cut`` / ``clipboard-copy`` / ``clipboard-paste`` (registration does not mean "
"visibility: agents still need ``add_tool`` to make them visible to the LLM);"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:23 of
msgid ""
"阶段二：``setup()`` 中 ``use_clipboard(self)``——登记缓冲状态键并 "
"设定阈值实例属性。``use_clipboard`` 可重复调用：``state.register`` "
"幂等（键已持久化时跳过并返回持久值），重复调用不报错，阈值以 最后一次调用为准；恢复时 ``setup()`` 在新实例上执行同样安全。"
msgstr ""
"Stage two: ``use_clipboard(self)`` in ``setup()`` — registers the buffer state key and sets the "
"threshold instance attributes. ``use_clipboard`` is repeatable: ``state.register`` is idempotent (skips "
"and returns the persisted value when the key is already persisted), repeated calls do not error, and "
"thresholds follow the last call; on recovery, ``setup()`` executing on a new instance is equally safe."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:28 of
msgid "注册的资源："
msgstr "Registered resources:"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:30 of
msgid ""
"工具注册：三件工具类（:class:`ClipboardCutTool` / :class:`ClipboardCopyTool` / "
":class:`ClipboardPasteTool`）注册进 Runtime 全局工具注册表；对 LLM 可见仍需 Agent 侧显式声明 "
"（``.fya`` ``tools:`` 或 ``agent.add_tool(...)``）。"
msgstr ""
"Tool registration: three tool classes (:class:`ClipboardCutTool` / :class:`ClipboardCopyTool` / "
":class:`ClipboardPasteTool`) registered into the Runtime global tool registry; visibility to the LLM "
"still requires explicit agent-side declaration (``.fya`` ``tools:`` or ``agent.add_tool(...)``)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:34 of
msgid ""
"Agent 状态键：``clipboard_buffer`` （``state.register(\"clipboard_buffer\", "
"None)``，默认 ``None`` 表示空剪贴板；写透到该 Agent 自己的 ``state.jsonl``，recover 可恢复）。"
msgstr ""
"Agent state key: ``clipboard_buffer`` (``state.register(\"clipboard_buffer\", None)``, default ``None`` "
"means an empty clipboard; write-through to that agent's own ``state.jsonl``, recoverable on recover)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:37 of
msgid ""
"阈值实例属性：``clipboard_max_lines`` / ``clipboard_max_chars`` （三件工具经 "
"``caller`` 读取）。"
msgstr ""
"Threshold instance attributes: ``clipboard_max_lines`` / ``clipboard_max_chars`` (read by the three "
"tools via ``caller``)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:40 of
msgid "声明的钩子点：无（剪贴板无事件面）。"
msgstr "Declared hook points: none (the clipboard has no event surface)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:41 of
msgid "挂载的钩子：无。"
msgstr "Mounted hooks: none."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:42 of
msgid ""
"未启用时的行为（未调用 ``use_clipboard`` 的 Agent）：零开销——无 ``clipboard_buffer`` "
"状态键、无阈值属性；此时调用三件工具 →  “剪贴板未启用”error ``ToolResult``。"
msgstr ""
"Behavior when not enabled (agents that never call ``use_clipboard``): zero overhead — no "
"``clipboard_buffer`` state key, no threshold attributes; calling the three tools at this point → a "
"\"clipboard not enabled\" error ``ToolResult``."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:47 of
msgid "缓冲契约（state 键 ``clipboard_buffer``）"
msgstr "Buffer contract (state key ``clipboard_buffer``)"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:48 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"值为 ``None`` （空）或 JSON 纯数据 dict：``{\"content\": str, \"origin_path\": str "
"| None, \"lines\": int, \"chars\": int}`` （state 值 必须 JSON "
"可序列化的硬约束——缓冲不落对象）。"
msgstr ""
"The value is ``None`` (empty) or a JSON plain-data dict: ``{\"content\": str, \"origin_path\": str "
"| None, \"lines\": int, \"chars\": int}`` (the hard constraint that state values must be "
"JSON-serializable — the buffer does not store objects)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:51 of
msgid ""
"每 Agent 一份 （per-agent state.jsonl 单 writer，多 Agent 天然 隔离）；跨 Agent "
"搬运经文件输出中转。"
msgstr ""
"One per agent (per-agent state.jsonl single writer, agents naturally isolated); cross-agent "
"transfer goes through file output as an intermediary."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:53 of
msgid "一次性语义：``paste`` 成功且来源为剪贴板 → 缓冲清空为 ``None`` （防止长期占用 state.jsonl 体积）。"
msgstr "One-shot semantics: when ``paste`` succeeds and the source is the clipboard → the buffer is cleared to ``None`` (prevents long-term occupation of state.jsonl volume)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:55 of
msgid ""
"阈值双限：cut/copy 进剪贴板的内容行数超过 ``clipboard_max_lines`` （默认 500）或字符数超过 "
"``clipboard_max_chars`` （默认 10k）→ 拒绝入缓冲，强制文件输出；文件输出无阈值。"
msgstr ""
"Dual threshold limits: content cut/copied into the clipboard with line count exceeding "
"``clipboard_max_lines`` (default 500) or character count exceeding ``clipboard_max_chars`` (default "
"10k) → rejected from the buffer, forced to file output; file output has no threshold."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:61 of
msgid "位置与路径口径"
msgstr "Position and Path Conventions"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:62 of
msgid ""
"路径遵循 ``cwd`` 基准制（与 builtins 全部工具同口径）： ``cwd=None`` "
"（默认）时一切文件参数仅收绝对路径；``cwd`` 非 ``None`` 时允许相对路径（相对 ``cwd`` 解析）；``cwd`` 自身必须是"
" 绝对路径。相对路径无基准或 ``cwd`` 非绝对 → error ``ToolResult``。 ``cwd`` 同时是“``.fya`` "
"定义期经智能体属性传参”的示范位 （Parsable 覆写 ``cwd: \"{{ cwd }}\"``，完整示例见 "
":mod:`flowing.builtins.tools` 模块 docstring）。"
msgstr ""
"Paths follow the ``cwd`` base convention (same convention as all builtins tools): with ``cwd=None`` "
"(default) all file parameters accept only absolute paths; when ``cwd`` is not ``None`` relative paths "
"are allowed (resolved relative to ``cwd``); ``cwd`` itself must be an absolute path. A relative path "
"without a base or a non-absolute ``cwd`` → error ``ToolResult``. ``cwd`` is also the demonstration slot "
"for \"passing parameters via agent attributes at ``.fya`` definition time\" (Parsable overriding ``cwd: "
"\"{{ cwd }}\"``; see the :mod:`flowing.builtins.tools` module docstring for a full example)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:69 of
msgid ""
"行号 1 起（对齐编辑器）、offset 0 起（对齐 Python 切片）； 区间一律 start 包含、end 排除；越界各自报错（fail-"
"fast：失败立即 报错，不静默降级）。"
msgstr ""
"Line numbers are 1-based (aligned with editors), offsets are 0-based (aligned with Python slicing); "
"ranges are always start-inclusive and end-exclusive; out-of-bounds errors are reported separately "
"(fail-fast: errors are reported immediately, with no silent degradation)."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard:73 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools` （三件工具）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron` （双层启用与同构的 state 键模式先例）"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools` (the three tools), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron` (precedent for two-stage enablement and the isomorphic state key pattern)"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.clipboard.rst:21
msgid "flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools module"

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools`` —— 剪贴板三件工具。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools`` — the three clipboard tools."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools:3 of
msgid ""
"本模块定义 ``clipboard-cut`` / ``clipboard-copy`` / ``clipboard-paste`` "
"三件工具类：:class:`ClipboardCutTool` （剪切）、:class:`ClipboardCopyTool` "
"（复制）、:class:`ClipboardPasteTool` （粘贴）。主模块 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard` 承载启用方式与缓冲契约。"
msgstr ""
"This module defines the three tool classes ``clipboard-cut`` / ``clipboard-copy`` / ``clipboard-paste``: "
":class:`ClipboardCutTool` (cut), :class:`ClipboardCopyTool` (copy), :class:`ClipboardPasteTool` (paste). "
"The main module :mod:`flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard` hosts the enablement and the buffer contract."

#: flowing.plugins.clipboard.tools:8 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard` （启用方式、 缓冲契约、路径与行号口径）"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.plugins.clipboard.clipboard` (enablement, buffer contract, path and line-number conventions)"
